80	      ? <>{trade.action === "cancel" ? "Cancellation sent to Scalable." : "Order sent to Scalable."}{proposal.result?.reference ? ` Reference ${proposal.result.reference}.` : ""} <Link href="/money/wealth" className="underline">Wealth</Link> shows it after the next sync.</>

